{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sounds of Shadows is a horror game where you play as B4-BY, a helper robot who worked for 4 scientists in an underground facility who were researching a new groundbreaking technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will be going through the facility to learn what happened and to save anyone who's still alive, but there is something else with you in the facility, something blind and dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn about the history of this place through scattered voice logs as you avoid the thing lurking in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See your environment through making sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sneak your way through, don't let it hear you, distract it by throwing the things left behind.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3642710?t=1750408414","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642710/4625be62ba32c534357c38c4955b8912eefddf24/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750408414","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642710/8e277582716bcde9563c23d47f14daff2b4f9170/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750408414","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642710/8e277582716bcde9563c23d47f14daff2b4f9170/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750408414","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"It is a horror game with a scary monster in it, Thus the monster is the mature content"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sounds of Shadows is a horror game where you play as B4-BY, a helper robot who worked for 4 scientists in an undergro